# Copy to .env.local for development. NEVER commit .env.local.
#
# Where design-partner enquiries from /contact and the homepage CTA are sent.
# Any endpoint that accepts a JSON POST works — a Zapier/Make catch hook, a
# Slack incoming webhook, a CRM intake, your own server.
#
# READ THIS: if this is unset in PRODUCTION, /api/waitlist returns 503 on
# purpose and the form shows its mailto fallback. That is deliberate. The
# alternative is answering "Received. We will be in touch shortly." while the
# enquiry goes to stdout and dies at the next cold start — thanking a design
# partner while dropping them on the floor.
#
# In development it is optional: enquiries are logged to the console instead.
WAITLIST_WEBHOOK_URL=
